{"author":"Rebar Bot Nava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"body":"Gerrit 3141 (commit f2779508196): LLM-Review +1, Verified -1. The one CI failure is tests/unit/test_review_bot.py::test_lifespan_drains_queued_events_on_shutdown, which this change does not touch; root cause filed as eastmost-uncheered-nematode (an unstubbed revision lookup must finish inside a 1 s test drain window). Holding 3141 until that fix lands, then rebasing for a fresh CI run; no recheck, because the failure is a test defect, not an environmental fault."},"env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1793307664105481001,"uuid":"92c9eb8f-a826-430d-a0d4-770c48582d56"}